WEBVTT

00:04:59.378 --> 00:05:02.506
a prize-winning violinist
at the New England Conservatory.

00:05:03.257 --> 00:05:07.845
My idea inspired and connected
hundreds of people from all walks of life

00:05:07.887 --> 00:05:11.557
to offer their time and expertise
to aspiring musicians like Sam

00:05:11.599 --> 00:05:13.267
from around the country.

00:05:13.267 --> 00:05:16.604
And now, just two and a half years later,

00:05:16.604 --> 00:05:19.315
this little idea has turned
into Through the Staff,

00:05:19.315 --> 00:05:23.361
a national nonprofit
that has provided almost 600,000 dollars

00:05:23.361 --> 00:05:25.529
of free virtual private lessons

00:05:25.529 --> 00:05:27.448
to almost 1000 young musicians

00:05:27.448 --> 00:05:31.202
from Fresno, California
to Wilkesboro, North Carolina.